# MySQL Assignment: Operators and Built-in Functions

## 1. Arithmetic Operators

```sql
-- Employee
SELECT Salary, Salary+1000, Salary-1000, Salary*2, Salary/2, Salary%1000 FROM Employee;

-- Customer
SELECT CustomerID, CustomerID+1, CustomerID-1, CustomerID*2, CustomerID/2, CustomerID%2 FROM Customer;

-- Student
SELECT Marks, Marks+5, Marks-5, Marks*2, Marks/2, Marks%2 FROM Student;

-- Staff
SELECT Salary, Salary+1000, Salary-1000, Salary*2, Salary/2, Salary%1000 FROM Staff;

-- Product
SELECT Price, Price+100, Price-100, Price*2, Price/2, Price%100 FROM Product;
```

